WEBVTT

00:00:14.290 --> 00:00:16.280
"Ruins are the Final Frontier!!
A Man's Dream!!! Join Us, Comrades!!!!"

00:00:26.240 --> 00:00:27.960
"Map of the Stars"

00:00:37.710 --> 00:00:40.020
Our poster didn't help at all!

00:00:40.020 --> 00:00:42.250
We still only have three people
in our Ruins Exploration Club!

00:00:42.250 --> 00:00:45.020
We're at risk of extinction here!

00:00:45.020 --> 00:00:47.560
We have to plot our strategy over summer break!

00:00:47.560 --> 00:00:49.530
I'm not <i>in</i> the Ruins Exploration Club...

00:00:49.530 --> 00:00:51.030
Senkawa!

00:00:51.030 --> 00:00:54.530
Don't you feel any responsibility
for getting us hooked on ruins

00:00:54.530 --> 00:00:58.030
when we kept your gloomy
ass company in junior high?

00:00:58.030 --> 00:00:59.400
It's not my fault.

00:00:59.400 --> 00:01:03.240
How about we make a promo video or something?

00:01:03.240 --> 00:01:06.040
We can put some music over
images of abandoned buildings.

00:01:06.040 --> 00:01:08.910
- Video?
- Whoa, good idea!

00:01:08.910 --> 00:01:11.210
We could make it on my PC.

00:01:11.210 --> 00:01:14.450
That's it! But the problem is money.

00:01:14.450 --> 00:01:15.520
Huh?

00:01:15.520 --> 00:01:18.960
There aren't any abandoned buildings
nearby that a newbie would love!

00:01:18.960 --> 00:01:21.020
So, train fare and hostel fare?

00:01:21.020 --> 00:01:25.700
Yes! Filming takes time.
We can't do it all in one day!

00:01:25.700 --> 00:01:28.230
You don't have to make
something that hard-core...

00:01:28.230 --> 00:01:29.630
Fool!

00:01:29.630 --> 00:01:34.740
This is life-or-death for our club!
Obviously we have to give it our all!

00:01:34.740 --> 00:01:37.210
I told you, I'm not in the club...

00:01:37.210 --> 00:01:40.880
Senkawa! You bastard, I can't believe you!

00:01:40.880 --> 00:01:42.410
Um...

00:01:42.410 --> 00:01:44.810
Nakasugi, I didn't know you were here.

00:03:21.810 --> 00:03:23.550
Well, hello, Mr. Hoity-Toity.

00:03:23.550 --> 00:03:26.820
It's not like I'm asking to take
a luxury cruise around the world...

00:03:26.820 --> 00:03:30.050
And while you're out fooling around,

00:03:30.050 --> 00:03:33.320
I'm supposed to take care
of the house all by myself?

00:03:33.320 --> 00:03:36.330
Cleaning, taking out the trash,
grocery shopping, all of it?

00:03:36.330 --> 00:03:38.320
"Ruins Club Summer Trip" "Sawajiri Village"

00:03:38.320 --> 00:03:38.590
Cleaning, taking out the trash,
grocery shopping, all of it?

00:03:38.590 --> 00:03:42.670
Who do you think you are?! It's not
like I asked you to come back here!

00:03:42.670 --> 00:03:44.670
It's my summer vacation!

00:03:44.670 --> 00:03:47.270
I don't want to spend it in my stuffy apartment,

00:03:47.270 --> 00:03:51.340
I want to spend it in our big,
comfy home sweet home!

00:03:51.340 --> 00:03:54.210
It's a universal human feeling!

00:03:54.210 --> 00:03:56.280
What's the big deal? It's just three days.

00:03:56.280 --> 00:03:58.920
Is that any way to ask for a favor?

00:03:58.920 --> 00:04:00.750
I'm on my summer vacation too, you know...

00:04:00.750 --> 00:04:03.420
Hey!

00:04:03.420 --> 00:04:05.620
Please, oh wonderful sister.

00:04:05.620 --> 00:04:07.590
"Wonderful sister," my butt.

00:04:07.590 --> 00:04:10.230
Pretty please?

00:04:10.230 --> 00:04:12.860
Well, I guess...

00:04:12.860 --> 00:04:14.230
Sis!

00:04:14.230 --> 00:04:18.870
In return, you get to take out all
the trash and buy all the groceries

00:04:18.870 --> 00:04:20.640
for the rest of summer break.

00:04:20.640 --> 00:04:22.940
I'll let you off of laundry duty.

00:04:22.940 --> 00:04:25.780
Stupid Hazumi...
She always holds things over me...

00:04:25.780 --> 00:04:28.710
You have no choice.
You want to go on the trip, right?

00:04:28.710 --> 00:04:32.780
Of course I do! It's an invitation from Nakasugi!

00:04:32.780 --> 00:04:35.650
Uh-oh, he's got hormone rush to the max.

00:04:35.650 --> 00:04:37.280
Don't call it a "hormone rush"!

00:04:37.820 --> 00:04:40.920
Is this really all right?

00:04:40.920 --> 00:04:43.960
Sayaka says she wants to go.

00:04:43.960 --> 00:04:46.800
There's nothing to worry
about if you'll be with her.

00:04:46.800 --> 00:04:49.570
If you say so, Sir...

00:04:49.570 --> 00:04:54.300
Sayaka's finally gotten well.
Please, let her do what she likes.

00:04:54.300 --> 00:04:55.290
Yes, Sir...

00:05:06.350 --> 00:05:09.490
That damn traitor Hazawa...

00:05:09.490 --> 00:05:11.590
When we get back I'm
gonna discipline him but good!

00:05:11.590 --> 00:05:15.160
Oh, get over it. Sudou and Chigira came.

00:05:15.160 --> 00:05:19.030
Yeah. He was lucky to win a
ticket for that Akihabara concert.

00:05:19.030 --> 00:05:24.100
Well, <i>I lost! And that moron won without me!</i>

00:05:24.100 --> 00:05:27.970
Okay, okay. Might as well have
fun while we're here, all right?

00:05:27.970 --> 00:05:31.970
Yep. Ryo's right.

00:05:31.970 --> 00:05:35.850
Kazu, take a shot of Nakasugi.
She'll make a good picture.

00:05:35.850 --> 00:05:37.950
- Hey Hayamiya! Get up!
- Kitamura wanted to come, but...

00:05:37.950 --> 00:05:39.180
Huh?

00:05:39.180 --> 00:05:42.720
We're going to shoot footage
of Nakasugi. You're in the way.

00:05:42.720 --> 00:05:44.490
What's that supposed to mean?

00:05:44.490 --> 00:05:46.690
The pretty girl by the window makes a good shot.

00:05:46.690 --> 00:05:48.490
Now scram.

00:05:48.490 --> 00:05:50.790
I'm a pretty girl, too!

00:05:50.790 --> 00:05:55.460
Go on, shoot. I'll let you request a pose.

00:05:55.460 --> 00:06:01.300
Roll 'em, Kazu. Keep the
megalomaniac girl out of the frame.

00:06:01.300 --> 00:06:02.290
Hmph!

00:06:15.750 --> 00:06:17.720
Hello, this is Yoshie Suzuki.

00:06:17.720 --> 00:06:20.560
This is Sayaka. We just got to the station.

00:06:20.560 --> 00:06:23.990
Can you make lunch for us? We're all starving.

00:06:23.990 --> 00:06:26.560
Shall I send a car for you now, Miss?

00:06:26.560 --> 00:06:28.560
No, that's okay, we'll take the bus.

00:06:28.560 --> 00:06:30.600
The bus?

00:06:30.600 --> 00:06:33.030
Yep! Okay, I'll see you later.

00:06:42.410 --> 00:06:45.610
There's nothing here.
Not even a convenience store!

00:06:45.610 --> 00:06:48.520
Yeah... It's so quiet.

00:06:48.520 --> 00:06:50.110
It's almost scary.

00:06:55.390 --> 00:06:57.390
Is that it, Nakasugi?

00:06:57.390 --> 00:07:00.400
Oh, that's right, I remember now.

00:07:00.400 --> 00:07:04.130
It was a nice hotel when I was little,

00:07:04.130 --> 00:07:07.800
but it had a slump quite a while
ago and went out of business.

00:07:07.800 --> 00:07:10.040
Its big selling point was the hot spring,

00:07:10.040 --> 00:07:12.070
but the government built a highway
on the other side of the mountain,

00:07:12.070 --> 00:07:14.380
and people stopped coming after that.

00:07:14.380 --> 00:07:16.650
Now that's a nice abandoned building!

00:07:16.650 --> 00:07:19.080
It's captivating my male heart!

00:07:19.080 --> 00:07:23.990
Captivating! Captivating!
Captivating! Captivating!

00:07:23.990 --> 00:07:24.980
Shut up!

00:07:27.290 --> 00:07:29.630
Got any more spuds, Auntie?

00:07:29.630 --> 00:07:30.830
"Spuds"?

00:07:30.830 --> 00:07:33.000
Oh, he means potato chips.

00:07:33.000 --> 00:07:36.430
Ah! If that's what ya want,
I'll get some from the back.

00:07:36.430 --> 00:07:39.800
Upsy-daisy... Wait just one minute!

00:07:39.800 --> 00:07:43.340
I'm sorry, but please do hurry,
or we'll miss the bus.

00:07:43.340 --> 00:07:48.610
Not to worry, the bus'll
wait for ya if we ask 'em to.

00:07:48.610 --> 00:07:52.250
We'll take a dozen cup ramen too, please!

00:07:52.250 --> 00:07:53.820
Sure!

00:07:53.820 --> 00:07:55.420
Sorry, Hayamiya.

00:07:55.420 --> 00:07:56.250
Hmm?

00:07:56.250 --> 00:07:58.750
For making you fret about me.

00:07:58.750 --> 00:08:01.020
I'm not doing that.

00:08:01.020 --> 00:08:06.630
You look all worried about me
every time I wipe sweat off my face.

00:08:06.630 --> 00:08:09.170
Well, hey, they're all <i>guys,</i>

00:08:09.170 --> 00:08:11.800
so they don't have the delicacy
to be considerate of others.

00:08:11.800 --> 00:08:13.800
This is super-heavy.

00:08:13.800 --> 00:08:16.140
Pipe down. I split the bags fair and square!

00:08:16.140 --> 00:08:19.210
Ryo, don't fight.

00:08:19.210 --> 00:08:23.310
But I think I'm okay.
I'm actually feeling pretty light on my feet.

00:08:23.310 --> 00:08:24.810
So don't worry.

00:08:24.810 --> 00:08:28.810
Wow, you really did get stronger, huh Nakasugi!

00:08:45.970 --> 00:08:48.970
Yes! We're here! We're on the scene!

00:08:48.970 --> 00:08:50.170
I told you to pipe down!

00:08:50.170 --> 00:08:53.180
Look over there. That's our vacation home.

00:08:53.180 --> 00:08:54.710
We're going to walk all the way there?

00:08:54.710 --> 00:08:55.700
Yeah!

00:08:56.550 --> 00:08:57.980
Come on, let's go.

00:09:03.220 --> 00:09:07.520
You know, when I was little,
this village was more lively.

00:09:07.520 --> 00:09:08.990
There were lots of kids, too.

00:09:08.990 --> 00:09:10.590
Depopulation, huh?

00:09:10.590 --> 00:09:13.500
They say all the young people leave.

00:09:13.500 --> 00:09:15.900
I haven't been here in seven years either.

00:09:28.210 --> 00:09:29.610
Yoshie!

00:09:36.220 --> 00:09:39.050
Man, I'm stuffed!

00:09:39.050 --> 00:09:42.290
Maybe it's not always a good
thing for food to be too tasty.

00:09:42.290 --> 00:09:45.760
You could've paced yourself a little.
Think about tomorrow!

00:09:45.760 --> 00:09:49.130
Says the guy who refilled his bowl three times.

00:09:49.130 --> 00:09:51.270
Well, I was eating for two, so...

00:09:51.270 --> 00:09:52.600
Two?

00:09:52.600 --> 00:09:57.270
l-I only ate enough for two,
but Sudou ate enough for three.

00:09:57.270 --> 00:09:59.380
That's pretty much the same difference.

00:09:59.380 --> 00:10:03.750
That maid looks scary, but she can sure cook!

00:10:03.750 --> 00:10:08.480
There's all kinds of uninhabited
houses upriver from here!

00:10:08.480 --> 00:10:11.620
This place is a treasure trove of ruins!

00:10:11.620 --> 00:10:16.160
Let's call Hayamiya and Nakasugi
later and play cards or something.

00:10:16.160 --> 00:10:19.590
Everybody here? Nakasugi says
she's going to show us something neat!

00:10:28.440 --> 00:10:31.340
Wow, I can see the whole Milky Way!

00:10:31.340 --> 00:10:35.330
Yeah, the air is clear here and
there are almost no lights around.

00:10:39.750 --> 00:10:40.820
What's that?

00:10:40.820 --> 00:10:45.690
My grandfather used to use
this for birdwatching. Take a look.

00:10:45.690 --> 00:10:46.920
What can you see?

00:10:46.920 --> 00:10:48.320
Just try it.

00:10:50.190 --> 00:10:53.030
Whoa, that's beautiful!

00:10:53.030 --> 00:10:56.670
What is it, Senkawa? Let me see!

00:10:56.670 --> 00:10:58.630
Let me see, too!

00:10:58.630 --> 00:11:00.170
Shut up!

00:11:00.170 --> 00:11:02.300
Show me! Come on, show me!

00:11:02.300 --> 00:11:03.340
I'm next.

00:11:03.340 --> 00:11:04.370
Let go, you jerk!

00:11:04.370 --> 00:11:06.010
- No!
- Let go!

00:11:06.010 --> 00:11:07.010
- No!
- What are you guys, grade schoolers?!

00:11:07.010 --> 00:11:09.110
- Sheesh!
- What are you guys, grade schoolers?!

00:11:09.110 --> 00:11:11.650
But let me see, too!

00:11:11.650 --> 00:11:13.050
Me first!

00:11:18.150 --> 00:11:20.620
I've never seen such pretty stars.

00:11:20.620 --> 00:11:25.530
That was Beta Cygni... Albireo,
from the constellation Cygnus.

00:11:25.530 --> 00:11:28.000
Do you know a lot about stars?

00:11:28.000 --> 00:11:31.500
Well, you know I've been
sickly since I was little, right?

00:11:31.500 --> 00:11:34.170
So I just naturally came
to like looking at the stars.

00:11:34.170 --> 00:11:35.700
Huh.

00:11:35.700 --> 00:11:40.380
That double star looks close by,
but it's actually really far away.

00:11:40.380 --> 00:11:42.980
How many kilometers?

00:11:42.980 --> 00:11:46.550
It's about 4,000 times further
than the Earth is from the Sun,

00:11:46.550 --> 00:11:49.720
so maybe around 600 billion kilometers.

00:11:49.720 --> 00:11:51.820
600 billion, huh?

00:11:51.820 --> 00:11:54.390
C'mon, let me see! C'mon!

00:11:54.390 --> 00:11:57.360
- I told you to let go!
- Whoa, they're gorgeous!

00:11:57.360 --> 00:11:59.500
Cut it out, you two!

00:11:59.500 --> 00:12:01.490
Come on! Come on!

00:12:03.230 --> 00:12:04.860
Wow.

00:12:07.100 --> 00:12:09.540
That was a pretty nice property!

00:12:09.540 --> 00:12:11.040
Did you get good footage?

00:12:11.040 --> 00:12:12.440
Perfect!

00:12:12.440 --> 00:12:16.580
Now, it's time for today's main event, but first...

00:12:16.580 --> 00:12:18.450
Here we go, I guess.

00:12:18.450 --> 00:12:19.950
No choice, huh?

00:12:19.950 --> 00:12:22.280
We did decide on the rule yesterday.

00:12:22.280 --> 00:12:24.250
Rock to practice!

00:12:24.250 --> 00:12:26.520
Rock, paper, scissors!

00:12:26.520 --> 00:12:28.560
And a redo!

00:12:28.560 --> 00:12:30.180
Redo! Redo!

00:12:36.970 --> 00:12:38.770
Are you liking the books here?

00:12:38.770 --> 00:12:40.940
Yeah, they're all great!

00:12:40.940 --> 00:12:44.110
The printing and binding on the
photo collections are top-notch!

00:12:44.110 --> 00:12:46.310
It's really amazing.

00:12:46.310 --> 00:12:48.580
You don't like this stuff?

00:12:48.580 --> 00:12:49.750
Not so much...

00:12:49.750 --> 00:12:53.920
I guess you're not the type to
like newspaper photos, huh?

00:12:53.920 --> 00:12:56.550
Anyway, let's go downstairs.

00:12:56.550 --> 00:12:59.250
Yoshie poured us some cold drinks.

00:12:59.250 --> 00:13:02.720
Awesome! I was just getting thirsty.

00:13:02.720 --> 00:13:06.930
Hmm, maybe I should have gone with the boys...

00:13:06.930 --> 00:13:10.630
That hotel says "keep out," so they'll
be in trouble if someone finds them.

00:13:10.630 --> 00:13:13.620
I'm sure they made some kind of plan.

00:13:15.070 --> 00:13:18.670
Kazu, can you hear me? Hey!

00:13:18.670 --> 00:13:23.150
It's fine, Ryo. We've got two antennas.

00:13:23.150 --> 00:13:26.680
Okay, I'll let it ring three times.
Sound like a good signal?

00:13:26.680 --> 00:13:28.980
Sure. Three rings.

00:13:28.980 --> 00:13:32.620
If you find something cool,
you better show me, too.

00:13:32.620 --> 00:13:36.490
I know, I know. See you.

00:13:36.490 --> 00:13:38.480
All right, let's explore!

00:13:42.700 --> 00:13:45.270
It's a treasure trove of ancient arcade games!

00:13:45.270 --> 00:13:47.770
Hey, Chigira, shine some light over here!

00:13:47.770 --> 00:13:48.700
Right.

00:13:48.700 --> 00:13:51.110
It's like we've gone back in time.

00:13:51.110 --> 00:13:54.110
Doesn't all this stuff remind you of a horror movie?

00:13:54.110 --> 00:13:57.680
Damn, there's so much good
material I don't know what to film!

00:13:57.680 --> 00:13:59.780
Chigira! You're in charge of lights for a while!

00:13:59.780 --> 00:14:00.980
Yeah, yeah.

00:14:00.980 --> 00:14:05.850
Senkawa! Go check out the upstairs! Hurry it up!

00:14:05.850 --> 00:14:07.480
Jeez, fine.

00:14:15.830 --> 00:14:18.820
Man, why do I have to stand guard?

00:14:20.640 --> 00:14:21.630
Crap...

00:14:27.210 --> 00:14:30.910
Are you on vacation, kid?
I've never seen you before.

00:14:30.910 --> 00:14:34.920
This place is practically the
definition of "scenic spot," huh?

00:14:34.920 --> 00:14:38.150
I mean, what a beautiful village!

00:14:38.150 --> 00:14:39.140
Huh?

00:14:45.890 --> 00:14:47.330
I wonder if he's onto us.

00:14:47.330 --> 00:14:51.160
No! We can't be found yet!

00:14:55.270 --> 00:14:58.340
Hey, there he goes.

00:14:58.340 --> 00:14:59.740
Safe!

00:15:03.880 --> 00:15:06.220
Senkawa, cancel the alert.

00:15:06.220 --> 00:15:10.620
I was watching.
Sudou wormed out of that pretty nice...

00:15:10.620 --> 00:15:13.190
Hey, what's wrong?

00:15:13.190 --> 00:15:16.460
Hey, Senkawa! Can you hear me?

00:15:16.460 --> 00:15:19.430
Answer me, dammit!

00:15:19.430 --> 00:15:22.030
It was a prank, duh!

00:15:22.030 --> 00:15:26.440
You could easily make those
prints by putting a shoe on a stick.

00:15:26.440 --> 00:15:27.540
Maybe so.

00:15:27.540 --> 00:15:30.770
But it was kind of shocking, huh?

00:15:30.770 --> 00:15:32.240
Maybe it was a ghost.

00:15:32.240 --> 00:15:33.280
Huh?

00:15:33.280 --> 00:15:35.810
That cop was telling me

00:15:35.810 --> 00:15:39.820
that last night, someone
heard kids laughing up here.

00:15:39.820 --> 00:15:42.150
But there wasn't a soul around.

00:15:42.150 --> 00:15:45.790
Stop it, Ryo, I can't handle that stuff.

00:15:45.790 --> 00:15:48.220
Sheesh, you're such a scaredy-cat.

00:15:48.220 --> 00:15:49.890
Kazu, behind you!

00:15:49.890 --> 00:15:52.090
Ghosts are scary!

00:15:52.090 --> 00:15:53.160
What's with him?

00:15:53.160 --> 00:15:56.230
I'm scared of ghosts! I'm so scared!

00:15:56.230 --> 00:15:58.270
Shut the hell up and let go of me, moron!

00:15:58.270 --> 00:16:00.260
I'm scared!

00:16:34.670 --> 00:16:37.510
Hurry up and awaken, Ryunka.

00:16:37.510 --> 00:16:40.840
No, I'm...

00:16:40.840 --> 00:16:46.010
You've been reborn, Sayaka.
Just like you wished.

00:16:46.010 --> 00:16:48.780
Like I... wished?

00:16:48.780 --> 00:16:52.620
Of course. That's why the Ryunka chose you.

00:16:52.620 --> 00:16:53.960
I've been chosen?

00:16:53.960 --> 00:16:57.360
Yes. And you wished for that.

00:17:00.960 --> 00:17:02.950
That's why I...

00:17:16.580 --> 00:17:19.010
Huh, they're dead.

00:17:21.720 --> 00:17:24.150
This one's still alive.

00:17:28.760 --> 00:17:29.930
"Ryunka"...

00:17:29.930 --> 00:17:35.000
With your help, the Ryunka
awakened from its long sleep,

00:17:35.000 --> 00:17:40.400
and with the Ryunka's help,
you gained a new life.

00:17:40.400 --> 00:17:42.230
Ryunka...

00:17:48.080 --> 00:17:52.680
Now fly...

00:17:52.680 --> 00:17:54.510
...Ryunka.

00:18:13.700 --> 00:18:16.100
Quiet, Pooch!

00:18:16.100 --> 00:18:23.100
Useless old mutt. Ya eat like a pig,
but ya never listen to a word l...

00:18:35.160 --> 00:18:37.590
What is this feeling?

00:18:43.900 --> 00:18:45.230
Nakasugi?

00:18:45.230 --> 00:18:49.240
What are you doing, Birdy?
I'm still sleepy, you know...

00:18:49.240 --> 00:18:51.070
Then sleep!

00:18:54.780 --> 00:18:57.770
C'mon, Birdy, what's up?

00:18:59.650 --> 00:19:00.480
Over there?!

00:19:00.480 --> 00:19:01.450
What is that?

00:19:01.450 --> 00:19:03.440
Just be quiet!

